      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Your data stays local",
      "items": [
        "Chapters, settings and the vector index are local files — open it offline",
        "Only model calls go online, and they can be switched to a local model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How a chapter is born",
      "items": [
        "Draft → Revise → Review → Finalize, each step confirmed by you",
        "After finalizing, five passes run in parallel: plot / cast / setups / voice / style"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Cheap and non-blocking",
      "items": [
        "Three-tier routing: heavy work to strong models, chores to cheap ones",
        "Local vector fallback keeps writing unblocked when a model is down"
      ]
    }
